        <h4 class="anatomy-subheading">Deconstructing the Six Universal Building Blocks</h4>
        <p class="ladder-narrative" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Every block in the architectural schematic above plays a vital, non-negotiable role in instruction execution. Below is a detailed deconstruction of their physical silicon implementation, critical timing paths, and how open-source designs diverge across the performance spectrum:
        </p>
