      <!-- Similarity 3 -->
      <div class="sim-card sim-abi">
        <div class="sim-header">
          <span class="sim-num num-yellow">03</span>
          <h4>Unified Toolchain &amp; Software ABI Portability</h4>
        </div>
        <p class="sim-lead">
          A single C firmware binary compiled with the open standard GNU toolchain runs on any of the evaluated cores:
        </p>
        <div class="sim-points-stack">
          <div class="sim-point-row">
            <span class="point-badge">Calling Convention (ILP32 / ILP32E)</span>
            <span class="point-desc">Function arguments passed in <code>a0&ndash;a7</code>, return values in <code>a0/a1</code>, saved registers in <code>s0&ndash;s11</code>, and stack pointer <code>sp</code> kept 16-byte aligned.</span>
